{"id":"40a9587a80026ff4","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-ef-game.md","title":"Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse Game","display":"df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-ef-game","aliases":["57-df-ef-game","df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse Game"],"display":"df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse Game","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-n-equivalence]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-ordered-pair]]","[[57-df-emptyset]]","[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-ef-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-ef-game</span><span>df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse Game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht-Fraisse Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f60efdcc5c3b9010\" href=\"?note=f60efdcc5c3b9010\" title=\"57-df-n-equivalence\">57-df-n-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c21b7996645091f7\" href=\"?note=c21b7996645091f7\" title=\"57-df-ordered-pair\">57-df-ordered-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2\" href=\"?note=bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2\" title=\"57-df-emptyset\">57-df-emptyset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a24d8667957b1216\" href=\"?note=a24d8667957b1216\" title=\"90-df-sequence-concatenation\">90-df-sequence-concatenation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 是同签名结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的游戏与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span> 等价式使用有限纯关系签名：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S=\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S=\\emptyset\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_S^k=\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_S^k=\\emptyset\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^k\">\\(\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^k\\)</span> 有限；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。这保证 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a> 的封闭约定对有限位置无额外函数约束，也保证有限秩类型只有有限多个。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in A^m\">\\(\\vec a\\in A^m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec b\\in B^m\">\\(\\vec b\\in B^m\\)</span> 是等长有限列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j&lt;m\\}\">\\(p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j&lt;m\\}\\)</span>。自然数、空列与有序对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2\" href=\"?note=bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2\" title=\"57-df-emptyset\">57-df-emptyset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"c21b7996645091f7\" href=\"?note=c21b7996645091f7\" title=\"57-df-ordered-pair\">57-df-ordered-pair</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span> 是在数学列末尾附加一个元素，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"f60efdcc5c3b9010\" href=\"?note=f60efdcc5c3b9010\" title=\"57-df-n-equivalence\">57-df-n-equivalence</a>。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"a24d8667957b1216\" href=\"?note=a24d8667957b1216\" title=\"90-df-sequence-concatenation\">90-df-sequence-concatenation</a> 的操作作用于数码，本文件不直接将任意论域元素传给该数码函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"f60efdcc5c3b9010\" href=\"?note=f60efdcc5c3b9010\" title=\"57-df-n-equivalence\">57-df-n-equivalence</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span> 比较所有秩至多 n 的<strong>开公式</strong>的全称赋值真值，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>；不改成仅比较句子的常见版本。因此对应式量化全部有限初始元组，而不只检查空位置。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nW_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\n\\vec a\\in A^m\\land\\vec b\\in B^m\\land p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nW_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\n\\vec a\\in A^m\\land\\vec b\\in B^m\\land p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nW_{k+1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle k+1,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[&amp;\\vec a\\in A^m\\land\\vec b\\in B^m\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle k,\\vec a\\frown\\langle a\\rangle,\\vec b\\frown\\langle b\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\langle k,\\vec a\\frown\\langle a\\rangle,\\vec b\\frown\\langle b\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_k)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nW_{k+1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle k+1,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[&amp;\\vec a\\in A^m\\land\\vec b\\in B^m\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle k,\\vec a\\frown\\langle a\\rangle,\\vec b\\frown\\langle b\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\langle k,\\vec a\\frown\\langle a\\rangle,\\vec b\\frown\\langle b\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_k)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\leq n}W_k,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\exists\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\leq n}W_k,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\exists\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对固定有限元组长度和秩，有限纯关系语言中只有有限多个公式类型。一个元组的完整类型可写成同秩有限合取；另一结构必须实现该类型，否则其否定在另一结构对所有赋值为真而在原结构并非如此。反向由逐元组类型匹配立即得到开公式的全称赋值真值一致。空位置的 n 步游戏只比较 n 秩句子，不能在本册既有 n-equivalence 约定下冒充显示的全元组条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f60efdcc5c3b9010","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-n-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"c21b7996645091f7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ordered-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-emptyset","status":"resolved","id":"bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-emptyset]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"a24d8667957b1216","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 是同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的游戏与 $\\equiv_n$ 等价式使用有限纯关系签名：$\\mathrm{Const}_S=\\emptyset$、$\\mathrm{Func}_S^k=\\emptyset$ 对所有 $k\\geq1$，且 $\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^k$ 有限；见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。这保证 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]] 的封闭约定对有限位置无额外函数约束，也保证有限秩类型只有有限多个。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的游戏与 $\\equiv_n$ 等价式使用有限纯关系签名：$\\mathrm{Const}_S=\\emptyset$、$\\mathrm{Func}_S^k=\\emptyset$ 对所有 $k\\geq1$，且 $\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^k$ 有限；见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。这保证 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]] 的封闭约定对有限位置无额外函数约束，也保证有限秩类型只有有限多个。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\vec a\\in A^m$、$\\vec b\\in B^m$ 是等长有限列，$p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j<m\\}$。自然数、空列与有序对见 [[57-df-omega]]、[[57-df-emptyset]]、[[57-df-ordered-pair]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-emptyset","status":"resolved","id":"bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\vec a\\in A^m$、$\\vec b\\in B^m$ 是等长有限列，$p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j<m\\}$。自然数、空列与有序对见 [[57-df-omega]]、[[57-df-emptyset]]、[[57-df-ordered-pair]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"c21b7996645091f7","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\vec a\\in A^m$、$\\vec b\\in B^m$ 是等长有限列，$p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j<m\\}$。自然数、空列与有序对见 [[57-df-omega]]、[[57-df-emptyset]]、[[57-df-ordered-pair]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f60efdcc5c3b9010","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\frown\\langle a\\rangle$ 是在数学列末尾附加一个元素，$\\equiv_n$ 见 [[57-df-n-equivalence]]。[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的操作作用于数码，本文件不直接将任意论域元素传给该数码函数。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"a24d8667957b1216","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\frown\\langle a\\rangle$ 是在数学列末尾附加一个元素，$\\equiv_n$ 见 [[57-df-n-equivalence]]。[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的操作作用于数码，本文件不直接将任意论域元素传给该数码函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f60efdcc5c3b9010","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[57-df-n-equivalence]] 的 $\\equiv_n$ 比较所有秩至多 n 的**开公式**的全称赋值真值，见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]；不改成仅比较句子的常见版本。因此对应式量化全部有限初始元组，而不只检查空位置。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[57-df-n-equivalence]] 的 $\\equiv_n$ 比较所有秩至多 n 的**开公式**的全称赋值真值，见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]；不改成仅比较句子的常见版本。因此对应式量化全部有限初始元组，而不只检查空位置。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_S=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_S^k=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^k","display":false},{"tex":"n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in A^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec b\\in B^m","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j<m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown\\langle a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nW_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\n\\vec a\\in A^m\\land\\vec b\\in B^m\\land p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nW_{k+1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle k+1,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[&\\vec a\\in A^m\\land\\vec b\\in B^m\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle k,\\vec a\\frown\\langle a\\rangle,\\vec b\\frown\\langle b\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_k)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\langle k,\\vec a\\frown\\langle a\\rangle,\\vec b\\frown\\langle b\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_k)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\leq n}W_k,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\exists\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W\\bigr)\\Bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":3167,"backlinks":[{"id":"983eb8fcfa54aec4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系签名条件，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\mathrm{PartIso}$、原单向 $\\mathrm{BackAndForth}$、$\\equiv$ 见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[57-df-back-and-forth]]、[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]。$\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[57-df-finite]]；$\\mathcal I$ 是按剩余步数分层的部分同构族，$p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}$。"},{"id":"83fa8e237c5c3ddb","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B$ 为非空有限集合。$\\equiv_n$ 保持 [[57-df-n-equivalence]] 对所有开公式的全称赋值版本；$W_n$ 为 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的递归获胜位置集。$\\varepsilon$ 为空元组。"},{"id":"86d2ffc4d9622936","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系语言条件及固定 $\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$W_n$ 为该文件的递归获胜位置集合。原 $\\equiv_n$ 比较所有开公式的全称赋值真值，故本文件 $G_n$ 明确表示全部有限初始元组的比较族，而不是仅从空位置出发的通常单局；其 Duplicator 获胜接口如下式。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[57-df-ef-game]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]